=2 Walkthrough
!Quicksand Caves-map1.jpg|right|Quicksand Map 1
!Quicksand Caves-map2.jpg|right|Quicksand Map 2
Trade enough {p:Crystals} to the {p:Conquest NPC} to raise your Rank bar and unlock the Mission, then accept it from the {n:Gate Guard}.
* Go to {z:Chateau d'Oraguille}, where you'll receive a cutscene upon entering.
* Speak to {p:Halver} for instructions.
** **(Optional)**: Interact with the two doors to the Princes' quarters for short cutscenes.
* Travel to the {z:Quicksand Caves} Map 2.
** The cave entrance at {z:Eastern Altepa Desert} (H-10) will place you on Map 2.
*** Located just east of the {p:Survival Guide} warp to {z:Eastern Altepa Desert}.
*** Alternatively, using the {p:Unity Warp} (Level 125) for {z:Quicksand Caves} will place you at (J-5) on Map 1. You will need to walk south and then west to (F-10) to reach Map 2.
* You will need to drop down a hole at (E-11) to reach an isolated portion of the map.
* Once you drop down, travel to the **Fountain of Kings** at (G-14).
* Clear the area and check **Fountain of Kings**. This will spawn 2 {p:Kraken|Category:Sea Monk} NMs: {m:Honor} and {m:Valor}:
** You can pull them one at a time, they will not link, but will aggro to {@a:Sound|Detects by Sound} sound.
** {m:Valor} uses {p:Hundred Fists}.
** {m:Honor} casts Paralyga and Silencega.
** It is possible to land {s:Blind} and {s:Gravity} on either, but both resist {s:Sleep}.
** Letting one depop and then defeating the other makes this a lot easier to deal with.
* Check the **Fountain of Kings** again, after the bodies disappear, for some {@k} {k:Drops of Amnio}.
* Return to {p:Halver}.
* Wait 1 Earth minute, then exit the Chateau (into {z:Northern San d'Oria}) for another cutscene.

